WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:04.700
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:04.700 --> 00:08.270
Omoi wa kouya o yuku

00:08.270 --> 00:16.180
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

00:21.350 --> 00:27.990
Yaketsuku hizashi no moto kimi wa nani omou?

00:27.990 --> 00:33.900
Urei no hitomi wa ima nani o utsusu?

00:33.900 --> 00:42.840
Mayowazu ni irareru no nara
step by step tayasui darou

00:42.840 --> 00:47.540
Kaze no you ni

00:47.540 --> 00:50.650
Ikusen no namida o koe

00:50.650 --> 00:54.150
Akatsuki no kouya o yuku

00:54.150 --> 01:00.690
Itsuka kizu wa ieru kara saa trust myself

01:00.690 --> 01:07.430
Don't be afraid kawaru koto wa
osoreru koto ja nai

01:07.430 --> 01:13.570
Kimi ga kimi de aru naraba will be with you

01:13.570 --> 01:20.240
Odayaka na hi o yume-mite

01:20.240 --> 01:27.550
Michi-naki tabiji wa tsuzuku

01:42.060 --> 01:43.930
Damn bastards...

01:43.930 --> 01:47.970
You've got nowhere left to
run now! The bounty is ours!

01:47.970 --> 01:49.870
Damn she-bounty hunter...

01:49.870 --> 01:54.430
We'll show you what happens to people
who steal other people's jeeps!

01:56.580 --> 01:57.980
Abbess!

01:57.980 --> 02:02.450
Be calm. We are under
the protection of the Lord.

02:02.450 --> 02:03.820
We will be fine.

02:03.820 --> 02:06.220
I hope so.

02:06.220 --> 02:07.820
We won't be protected.

02:07.820 --> 02:09.060
What?

02:09.060 --> 02:13.260
No one will protect us.

02:13.260 --> 02:14.990
Ellis...

02:30.080 --> 02:32.280
- Ouch.
- Ellis?!

02:32.280 --> 02:34.180
I got hit.

02:34.180 --> 02:36.920
Where?!

02:36.920 --> 02:38.610
My forehead.

02:40.760 --> 02:45.090
Ellis is a life form created
by the hands of man.

02:48.930 --> 02:51.130
R-339.

02:51.130 --> 02:55.500
There, a certain government project
is being carried out in secret.

02:55.500 --> 02:56.840
The man in charge of it

02:56.840 --> 02:59.810
is well-known even within the Agency
as one of its best and brightest.

02:59.810 --> 03:02.610
Douglas Rosenberg.

03:02.610 --> 03:03.810
Rosenberg.

03:03.810 --> 03:06.280
This is Hayward of the Audit Department.

03:06.280 --> 03:08.450
Ah, Miss Hayward.

03:08.450 --> 03:10.520
Um, as I have repeatedly mentioned,

03:10.520 --> 03:13.350
regarding the excessive
investigative expenses...

03:13.350 --> 03:15.390
I must apologize.

03:15.390 --> 03:18.830
I am currently in the middle
of a meeting, so you see...

03:18.830 --> 03:22.560
Oh? It seems yet another new report has arrived.

03:22.560 --> 03:24.670
I will call you back later.

03:24.670 --> 03:26.160
Pardon me.

03:27.340 --> 03:28.890
Come in.

03:34.980 --> 03:38.050
You got me.

03:38.050 --> 03:42.180
Do you always have meetings by yourself?

03:42.180 --> 03:44.670
I suppose that depends on the situation.

03:47.390 --> 03:50.590
This is a detailed list of
the expenses that were filed.

03:50.590 --> 03:53.190
The ambiguous entries have been marked,

03:53.190 --> 03:55.160
so please look over it.

03:55.160 --> 03:59.900
I think you would look more
beautiful without your glasses.

03:59.900 --> 04:03.170
Please inform me when you
have finished looking over it.

04:03.170 --> 04:04.760
Excuse me.

04:08.340 --> 04:11.510
Having an obstinate nature
is such a disadvantage.

04:13.680 --> 04:17.580
It forces you to forego golden opportunities.

04:19.050 --> 04:21.540
Right, Ellis?

04:38.570 --> 04:42.080
- I dropped it.
- Shh, quiet.

04:42.080 --> 04:43.870
Yessir.

04:45.310 --> 04:47.120
I'm sorry to have gotten you involved.

04:47.120 --> 04:49.780
All because we took refuge here...

04:49.780 --> 04:54.090
Do not be. This is merely
another test the Lord has given us.

04:54.090 --> 04:57.420
- Yes.
- Oh, is that right?

05:02.760 --> 05:05.490
And this one's feeling no pressure at all.

05:18.080 --> 05:20.570
- I got hit again.
- Shh!

05:48.610 --> 05:50.980
That was close.

05:50.980 --> 05:52.650
God has kept us safe.

05:52.650 --> 05:55.650
O Lord, thank you!

05:55.650 --> 05:57.480
Yeah, yeah.

06:01.720 --> 06:05.020
Now, then, what to do?

06:08.630 --> 06:11.870
The windows are a no-go, so... Right.

06:11.870 --> 06:15.040
Okay, Ellis and I are
going to draw their attention,

06:15.040 --> 06:17.540
so you run out the front
while they're distracted.

06:17.540 --> 06:18.710
That makes sense!

06:18.710 --> 06:21.340
No, there will be no need for that.

06:21.340 --> 06:23.240
- What?
- Why not?

06:23.240 --> 06:24.910
This is a convent.

06:24.910 --> 06:29.820
It is our mission to protect the lost sheep.

06:29.820 --> 06:31.050
That makes sense!

06:31.050 --> 06:34.490
What are you saying? We're dealing
with bounty hunters here.

06:34.490 --> 06:36.660
Don't you care that you might get killed?

06:36.660 --> 06:39.660
God is with us.

06:39.660 --> 06:42.160
You know...

06:42.160 --> 06:44.720
Oh? Come to think of it, where's Ellis?

06:47.840 --> 06:49.860
And... she's sleeping.

07:09.460 --> 07:12.360
A physicist was murdered

07:12.360 --> 07:16.390
and a certain girl became wanted for
the crime with a bounty on her head.

07:27.540 --> 07:31.610
The physicist who was murdered,
Dr. Heinz Schneider,

07:31.610 --> 07:36.610
had been entrusted with the long-term
research and observation of the girl.

07:43.090 --> 07:45.060
That girl was Ellis.

07:50.900 --> 07:53.160
This kid is hopeless.

07:58.070 --> 08:00.110
Pardon?

08:00.110 --> 08:02.640
We will chase those people away using these.

08:02.640 --> 08:03.850
Yes!

08:03.850 --> 08:06.410
Well... uh...

08:06.410 --> 08:08.970
But our opponents are armed with guns...

08:13.350 --> 08:15.190
Come on, now...

08:16.520 --> 08:18.960
According to her traveling companion's reports,

08:18.960 --> 08:24.930
Ellis is currently lacking part of
her memory concerning the incident.

08:24.930 --> 08:28.000
Why was Dr. Schneider killed?

08:28.000 --> 08:31.110
Was it really Ellis who killed him?

08:31.110 --> 08:36.270
If we cannot restore her lost memory,
the truth will remain shrouded.

08:43.120 --> 08:44.850
I'm going to go take a quick look.

08:44.850 --> 08:47.320
- Stay here.
- Right.

08:47.320 --> 08:50.120
If they should come in here,
we will take them down with one blow.

08:50.120 --> 08:53.630
How reassuring.

08:53.630 --> 08:56.960
- Then...
- I'm coming, too.

08:56.960 --> 08:58.660
Ellis?

09:00.570 --> 09:02.970
- And what's that?
- A weapon.

09:02.970 --> 09:05.510
That's not going to work.

09:05.510 --> 09:07.740
Two of them.

09:07.740 --> 09:10.730
At the very least,
pick something a little bigger.

09:28.100 --> 09:33.000
The project being carried out
in R-339 is called "Leviathan,"

09:33.000 --> 09:37.340
the name of an evil monster
that appears in the Old Testament.

09:37.340 --> 09:39.700
You are three minutes late.

09:44.180 --> 09:47.750
Your watch is fast.

09:47.750 --> 09:51.190
There was still one survivor left.

09:51.190 --> 09:55.290
I guess academic types are good at hiding.

09:55.290 --> 09:57.120
I'll be counting on you.

10:00.600 --> 10:04.070
There must be other ways to
handle this than to eliminate them.

10:04.070 --> 10:05.870
It is the will of the government.

10:05.870 --> 10:07.570
The government, huh?

10:07.570 --> 10:09.430
The government...

10:23.120 --> 10:26.220
While Rosenberg is tracking Ellis's whereabouts,

10:26.220 --> 10:29.310
he is also involved in various
other clandestine activities.

10:32.990 --> 10:34.500
Found them.

10:34.500 --> 10:36.400
We're going to lure them outside.

10:36.400 --> 10:39.230
I don't want to involve
the nuns in this any further.

10:39.230 --> 10:40.770
Yessir.

10:40.770 --> 10:42.830
Hey there, you two!

10:49.810 --> 10:51.680
Hold it right there!

10:59.950 --> 11:02.080
Just a little further, Ellis.

11:03.820 --> 11:05.450
Ellis?!

11:06.860 --> 11:08.450
Freeze.

11:13.300 --> 11:15.200
Hi.

11:15.200 --> 11:16.970
Well, this sucks.

11:16.970 --> 11:19.100
Drop your gun.

11:26.450 --> 11:30.550
Oh, sorry about that.
I accidentally squeezed off a round.

11:30.550 --> 11:32.850
- Ow.
- Ellis!

11:34.660 --> 11:36.560
Nadie!

11:36.560 --> 11:39.730
Ow...

11:39.730 --> 11:41.960
Oh, my, this is terrible.

11:46.330 --> 11:48.670
Tell me, where do you want it?

11:48.670 --> 11:50.810
Your stomach? Your boobs?

11:50.810 --> 11:54.830
Or perhaps... that sassy face of yours?

12:18.400 --> 12:22.560
There was once a group of
people who were called witches.

12:46.190 --> 12:49.060
The magic these legendary witches possessed

12:49.060 --> 12:54.700
was the ability to freely control
molecular motion found in nature.

12:54.700 --> 12:58.730
A power commonly known as "Maxwell's Demon."

13:02.380 --> 13:04.110
Wh-What the hell?!

13:05.910 --> 13:07.400
Damn!

13:09.250 --> 13:11.590
Ow!

13:11.590 --> 13:13.390
Y-You people...

13:13.390 --> 13:15.460
- O Lord! O Lord!
- Ow!

13:15.460 --> 13:18.790
- Forgive us! Please... forgive us!
- Hold on...

13:20.130 --> 13:21.990
Sisters...

13:23.760 --> 13:25.990
- Are you all right?
- Yes.

13:27.330 --> 13:29.630
But what in the world?

13:32.240 --> 13:34.110
It was divine protection.

13:34.110 --> 13:35.740
What?

13:37.410 --> 13:39.000
Nadie...

13:44.820 --> 13:46.750
Ellis, can you walk?

13:46.750 --> 13:48.960
- I'm fine.
- Good.

13:48.960 --> 13:51.660
Nadie...

13:51.660 --> 13:55.320
We can't very well take lives
in a convent, after all.

13:58.270 --> 13:59.930
Abbess?

14:04.610 --> 14:06.870
Damn it all!

14:06.870 --> 14:08.840
You're not getting away!

14:11.950 --> 14:14.440
May God be with you.

14:23.960 --> 14:28.120
Over time, the witches died out.

14:37.170 --> 14:41.140
However, a thousand years later,

14:41.140 --> 14:44.210
a modern magic called genetic engineering...

14:44.210 --> 14:47.980
...brought that legend back to life.

14:58.660 --> 15:03.860
The modern witch that
Project Leviathan gave birth to...

15:03.860 --> 15:05.860
That is Ellis.

15:08.370 --> 15:12.500
It is as yet unknown just how powerful she is...

15:16.910 --> 15:18.510
Aw, man...

15:18.510 --> 15:21.620
Look at all the bullets they're
just firing off. What a waste.

15:21.620 --> 15:24.180
They must be pretty ticked off.

15:24.180 --> 15:27.190
Nadie, there're no more people around.

15:27.190 --> 15:29.420
Yeah, I think it's about time.

15:29.420 --> 15:32.390
All right, Ellis, ease off the gas.

15:32.390 --> 15:34.380
- There.
- And there.

15:36.860 --> 15:38.270
Ellis, go!

15:38.270 --> 15:39.890
Yessir!

15:41.540 --> 15:43.040
What's with those bitches?!

15:43.040 --> 15:44.540
They're going to take us head-on?

15:44.540 --> 15:46.370
How dare they mess with us!

15:55.450 --> 15:57.710
- Nadie?
- I'll be fine.

16:01.490 --> 16:04.090
I don't think you'll be able to hear me, but...

16:04.090 --> 16:06.490
If you have any last words, say them now.

16:36.460 --> 16:38.290
There must be a reason...

16:38.290 --> 16:40.690
...why Rosenberg hasn't
taken Ellis into safe custody.

16:40.690 --> 16:42.430
And I have a feeling...

16:42.430 --> 16:45.760
...there are personal
circumstances behind that reason.

16:49.100 --> 16:50.870
Ah, here you are, Doug!

16:50.870 --> 16:53.140
I apologize for being late.

16:53.140 --> 16:58.180
You've certainly become a big shot.
Keeping the governor waiting!

16:58.180 --> 16:59.480
I'm kidding.

16:59.480 --> 17:02.050
No, we were the ones who were early.

17:02.050 --> 17:05.180
When you get older, you come to
be early for everything. It's bad.

17:06.950 --> 17:11.030
This is Douglas Rosenberg.
He's a real go-getter.

17:11.030 --> 17:13.790
Doug, this is Senator Ritgen.

17:13.790 --> 17:15.060
Pleased to meet you.

17:15.060 --> 17:18.970
I like the look in your eyes.
That's German blood for you.

17:18.970 --> 17:20.070
How kind of you to say so.

17:20.070 --> 17:22.060
Come, sit down.

17:35.880 --> 17:38.050
It could be...

17:38.050 --> 17:40.250
...that the reason he doesn't
take Ellis into safe custody

17:40.250 --> 17:44.160
is the one weakness that
ambitious Rosenberg has.

17:50.260 --> 17:51.890
Nadie?

17:53.330 --> 17:54.900
As an escort for Ellis,

17:54.900 --> 17:58.170
I hired a bounty hunter.
One with a questionable history.

17:58.170 --> 18:01.840
She's a wild one.
Things will not go as expected.

18:03.540 --> 18:07.920
And Rosenberg's plans
will surely gradually crumble.

18:07.920 --> 18:11.090
In time, Rosenberg will show his true colors.

18:11.090 --> 18:15.060
And when he does, that will be our chance.

18:15.060 --> 18:18.190
Without fail, I will...

18:18.190 --> 18:21.720
...drive Project Leviathan to dissolution.

18:32.470 --> 18:34.580
- Thank you.
- Think nothing of it.

18:34.580 --> 18:37.480
I am the one who should be thanking you, Nadie.

18:37.480 --> 18:40.050
- What?
- Thanks to you,

18:40.050 --> 18:43.880
we were able to overcome a great test.

18:43.880 --> 18:45.950
Abbess...

18:45.950 --> 18:47.890
Besides which...

18:47.890 --> 18:49.390
It was fun.

18:49.390 --> 18:50.880
What?

19:14.080 --> 19:15.570
Oh...

19:24.090 --> 19:26.430
A new detailed expense report.

19:26.430 --> 19:28.920
I believe you will find no
problems with it this time.

19:31.130 --> 19:34.030
Thank you so much for bringing it all this way.

19:34.030 --> 19:35.800
Bye now.

19:38.140 --> 19:41.310
The dinner at that restaurant
is excellent, don't you think?

19:41.310 --> 19:42.810
What?

19:42.810 --> 19:47.780
Their chef is Japanese and his
sauces are in a class of their own.

19:47.780 --> 19:49.370
Bye now.

19:58.630 --> 20:00.990
Jody Hayward...

20:06.000 --> 20:07.400
Rosenberg.

20:07.400 --> 20:09.170
Ah, it's you.

20:09.170 --> 20:11.000
Where are you right now?

20:46.210 --> 20:49.610
- Ellis! Ellis, calm down!
- No! No, no!

20:49.610 --> 20:53.680
- Ellis! Ellis, please don't struggle.
- No!

20:53.680 --> 20:55.350
I don't wanna.

20:55.350 --> 20:57.910
I don't wanna do that anymore!

21:00.950 --> 21:02.550
Ellis...

21:05.290 --> 21:06.950
I don't wanna.

21:10.930 --> 21:15.040
All right. No more examinations.

21:15.040 --> 21:18.800
We'll never do another one again. I promise.

21:22.980 --> 21:25.640
I promise you, Ellis.

21:28.220 --> 21:29.880
Ellis...

21:29.880 --> 21:32.420
Promise?

21:32.420 --> 21:34.980
Yes, I promise.

21:36.390 --> 21:38.120
Doctor...

21:42.900 --> 21:45.130
Ellis, it's about time we...

21:48.170 --> 21:50.430
And she's still sleeping.

21:53.740 --> 21:55.470
Doctor...

22:30.440 --> 22:32.180
Ellis is...

22:32.180 --> 22:34.270
...not a child of God.

22:36.620 --> 22:40.350
Owaranai natsu no you ni

22:40.350 --> 22:43.890
Chiranai hana no you ni

22:43.890 --> 22:47.790
Dakishimeta sono ude o

22:47.790 --> 22:55.960
Zutto hanasanaide ite yo

23:02.210 --> 23:05.710
Sugari-tsuite-mitemo

23:05.710 --> 23:11.490
Mune wa mada chigau hakanasa de

23:11.490 --> 23:15.420
Toki no rizumu kazoeteru

23:15.420 --> 23:19.560
Akai hoshi no yoru

23:19.560 --> 23:23.560
Kiete-yuku nukumori

23:23.560 --> 23:27.500
Tsunagi-tometai no yo

23:27.500 --> 23:34.010
Hitomi tojita kimi o

23:34.010 --> 23:37.940
Akogare o kuri-kaeshi

23:37.940 --> 23:41.380
Doko e mo yukenaku-temo

23:41.380 --> 23:45.420
Setsunasa no tachidomaru

23:45.420 --> 23:51.790
Kono hito-toki ga futari no

23:51.790 --> 23:56.790
Subete yo
